@nutriclinica_backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5036

### Login
# @name login
POST {{nutriclinica_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correoElectronico": "admin@nutriclinica.cl",
  "contrasena": "NutriClinica2026"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Nutricionista autenticado
# @name yo
GET {{nutriclinica_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/yo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pacientes (requiere token)
GET {{nutriclinica_backend_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh token
POST {{nutriclinica_backend_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Subir foto (multipart)
# @name subirFoto
POST {{nutriclinica_backend_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes/{{pacienteId}}/fotos/subir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Bound

------Bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="archivo"; filename="frente.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./Assets/frente.jpg
------Bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="consultaId"

{{consultaId}}
------Bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tipo"

0
------Bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notas"

Progreso post inicio de plan
------Bound--

### Subir foto sin archivo (debe devolver 400)
POST {{nutriclinica_backend_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes/{{pacienteId}}/fotos/subir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Bound

------Bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tipo"

0
------Bound--

### Subir documento (multipart)
# @name subirDocumento
POST {{nutriclinica_backend_HostAddress}}/api/pacientes/{{pacienteId}}/documentos/subir
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Bound

------Bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="archivo"; filename="analisis.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./Assets/analisis.pdf
------Bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tipo"

0
------Bound
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="observaciones"

Analisis de control
------Bound--
